course: dictionary
lesson: 10801
title: Short forms and context: var
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are short forms, called abbreviations, of longer words or phrases. «var» is one of these, and it can stand for different things. The words around it tell you which one.
explain: In coding, «var score = 0;» means make a variable called score. A variable is a named box that holds a value. The code words around var are the clue.
explain: In football, «VAR checked the goal» means the video assistant referee looked at it. Capital letters, the word goal, and the football talk around it all point to this meaning.
explain: Maths and plant names use it too. «var.» is short for variety, and var can be short for variance, which tells how spread out numbers are. Always check the context before you decide what a short form means.
fact: An abbreviation is a shortened form of a word or phrase.
fact: In coding, «var» is short for variable: a named box that holds a value.
fact: VAR stands for video assistant referee: officials who watch replays on screens to help the referee.
fact: VAR checks only four kinds of decision: goals, penalties, straight red cards and mistaken identity.
fact: On its own, «var» is not a normal word you use in everyday sentences, so always look at the words around it.
exercise: In the code «var score = 0;», what does var mean? | Very angry robot | Video of the goal replay | *Variable, a named box that holds a value | Victory for the team
exercise: Darnell shouts «VAR, check EVERYTHING!» at the telly. What does VAR stand for? | *Video assistant referee | Variable across the league | Victory after a rough ride | Very active rugby
exercise: Which of these does VAR check? | Corner kicks | *Goals | Throw-ins | Crowd noise
test: In plant names, «var.» is short for which word? | Victory | Video | Variable | *Variety
test: «VAR only steps in for clear and obvious errors.» What does this mean? | *VAR only helps when a mistake is clear and obvious | VAR watches the crowd | Every throw-in is checked, however small | VAR decides the final score
exam: In «VAR was used at the 2018 World Cup and came to the Premier League a year later, in 2019.», what does VAR stand for? | Victory after a rough ride | Variable across the league | *Video assistant referee | Very amazing rules
